# Navigating to channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* ensuring channel <channelAlias> exists in fixture for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-testid='nav-chat']"
* clicking on stored channel <channelAlias> name for user <userAlias>
* waiting for network to be idle

# Creating channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias> in project <projectAlias>
* ensuring project <projectAlias> exists in fixture for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-testid='nav-chat']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='create-new-channel']" to appear
* clicking on "[data-testid='create-new-channel']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='add-channel-form']" to appear
* generating net-new channel details <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-testid='project-select-trigger']"
* selecting stored project <projectAlias> for user <userAlias> in dropdown
* typing stored user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias> field "name" in "[data-testid='channel-name-input']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='create-channel-button']" to be enabled
* clicking on "[data-testid='create-channel-button']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='add-channel-dialog']" to disappear
* capturing created channel details for user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias>
* clicking on selector "[role='dialog'] button" with text "Cancel" if visible
* waiting for "[data-testid='channel-info-trigger']" to appear
